Historical fix8c synthetic suite (non-authoritative)
====================================================

Archived from the former package-root summary.  It reported 15 passing cases
at `/tmp/task7f-final-synthetic-suite-3`, but HUP/INT/TERM and repeated TERM
were sent directly to the Python supervisor rather than to the full outer
reproducer's published shell PID.  It therefore cannot establish current
outer signal forwarding or conventional outer exit statuses.

